    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ohnoyoureawakeagain4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ohnoyoureawakeagain4.webp",
      "alt": "ohnoyoureawakeagain4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The plan was a failure.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Not only was I alone when I opened my eyes, but I wasn’t even in the place they likely closed in.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "As such, I’m here again.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It was easy this time.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I understood everything that was happening the whole way here.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And I understand everything now that I’ve arrived.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The world is going to end.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But I am going to be okay.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Because there are still things that I have to do.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And there is still something out there that wants to keep me alive.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I understand that now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "God is real.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He’s just abandoned us.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ohnoyoureawakeagain5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ohnoyoureawakeagain5.webp",
      "alt": "ohnoyoureawakeagain5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh my God...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who’s ready for a field trip back to roughly two months into the school year?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ohnoyoureawakeagain6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ohnoyoureawakeagain6.webp",
      "alt": "ohnoyoureawakeagain6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you have any idea how long you’ve been gone?! I was worried sick!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I thought I’d never see you again! Where were you? Where did you go?! Why did you leave?!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Was she like this when you couldn’t find me as well?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not even close.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So it’s just you she’ll break down for. Got it.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ohnoyoureawakeagain7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ohnoyoureawakeagain7.webp",
      "alt": "ohnoyoureawakeagain7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How are you so calm?! You’ve been like this the whole time! I don’t get it! You love him too, don’t you?! Why aren’t you showing it?!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m calm because I’ve been through this more times than you could even imagine. One week is nothing.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A week? You two have been here for an entire week?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ohnoyoureawakeagain8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ohnoyoureawakeagain8.webp",
      "alt": "ohnoyoureawakeagain8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes. And kudos to Ayane for not breaking down until the fourth day. She was actually rather stable and mostly bearable beforehand.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sorry to hear that. I obviously didn’t mean to keep you waiting that long.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just be happy the world hasn’t reset without you. Apart from that, I have some good news and bad news.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The bad news is, unfortunately, it appears that both of our new companions have been left behind. Of course, that can not be said definitively given what happened last time, but still.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s probably safe to assume they won’t be joining us.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The good news is that we did manage to learn that it is possible for others to learn of the loops without any immediately negative consequences.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We still don’t know just what prerequisites are required to get the others to a point like that, but we know now that it is possible. Progress has been made and a celebration is in order.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or...will be in order. I didn’t exactly pack a picnic this time and, even if I had, I’m sure none of the food would still be very edible.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s really you...right? You’re not some memory-wiped replacement of Sensei that Maya conjured up to get me to stop crying?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ohnoyoureawakeagain9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ohnoyoureawakeagain9.webp",
      "alt": "ohnoyoureawakeagain9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just who exactly do you think I am?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Someone who has not made the last week very easy for me, that’s for sure.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Get a grip. If you really are going to become a regular member of our rooftop get-togethers, you’re going to have to get accustomed to...prolonged leaves of apocalyptic absence from time to time.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course, there’s no guarantee you’ll still be here once the world resets anyway, but I digress.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Still holding onto your pregnancy theory even though Ayane made it here again despite an entire cycle of abstinence?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ohnoyoureawakeagain10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ohnoyoureawakeagain10.webp",
      "alt": "ohnoyoureawakeagain10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not as if I surveyed you the entire time. You very well could have gone behind my back and created a secret child. I know exactly how insatiable the two of you are.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But assuming I do believe you, I’ll be holding onto my theory until the sun comes back up.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ohnoyoureawakeagain11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ohnoyoureawakeagain11.webp",
      "alt": "ohnoyoureawakeagain11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Which could very well be any minute now that Sensei is-",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? Why are you looking at me like that?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You need to learn to be more sensitive with other people’s feelings.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If I haven’t learned that trait by now, it’s probably safe to assume I’m either never going to, or...have just neglected to really hone it.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...am going to have...so much sex next cycle. Just to spite you.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can’t help but be a little offended by that. I don’t think I’ve ever been used for revenge sex before.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ohnoyoureawakeagain12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ohnoyoureawakeagain12.webp",
      "alt": "ohnoyoureawakeagain12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei...I’m so glad you’re back. This was somehow even worse than the first time I couldn’t find you — and that’s in no small part to understanding just what’s at stake now.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Next time the world is about to end, instead of a slumber party, I’m just going to tie myself to you. That way, you won’t be able to get away and I won’t lose my very last bit of sanity.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can you tell her to stop rambling on about the next cycle when we still don’t technically know if-",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Knock it off, Maya. There’s no harm in letting her be a little hopeful.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ohnoyoureawakeagain13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ohnoyoureawakeagain13.webp",
      "alt": "ohnoyoureawakeagain13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If she’s going to have to get accustomed to “prolonged leaves of apocalyptic absence,” you’re going to have to get used to being wrong sometimes.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t know everything anymore. You’re in the same exact boat as us. So stop trying to sound all knowledgeable and just figure shit out along the way like a real human.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We almost kiss one time and now you think it’s okay to talk to me like I am inferior to you. Real nice.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What part of the “same boat” do you not get? You’re not inferior. You’re on the same level as us.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t think you understand how boats work. Boats have captains...crewmen...other...boat-people. They’re not all on the same level just because they’re on a single seafaring vessel.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, everyone on this boat is on the same level. End of discussion.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have a boat. I just can’t really get to it anymore on account of the wall.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I said “end of discussion.” That means you too, Ayane.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ohnoyoureawakeagain14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ohnoyoureawakeagain14.webp",
      "alt": "ohnoyoureawakeagain14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Got it.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I like the side of you that puts Maya in her place. Any time I try to do that, she just makes me feel really bad about myself.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have not been put in place. I just see no point in continuing to argue about a topic as stupid as boats when the world is about to end.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s really weird that we’ve gotten to a point where sentences like that aren’t all that strange.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ohnoyoureawakeagain15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ohnoyoureawakeagain15.webp",
      "alt": "ohnoyoureawakeagain15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It really is.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Aww...damn it.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How am I supposed to stay mad at you when you look like that?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This calls for a group hug! We can celebrate with that instead of a picnic.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ohnoyoureawakeagain16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ohnoyoureawakeagain16.webp",
      "alt": "ohnoyoureawakeagain16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh? Are you already forgetting that something like that is exactly how we get out of this mess?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course not. It just feels a little less formal if we’re doing it because we love one another and not because God likes watching people hug or something.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I couldn’t have said it better myself.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You definitely could have. That wasn’t my greatest line.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You said it, not me.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene ohnoyoureawakeagain17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/ohnoyoureawakeagain17.webp",
      "alt": "ohnoyoureawakeagain17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Alright! Bring it in, everybody! Time for another field trip through time!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, before we go back...there’s something I want to say.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is it that you actually love me and that you’re only mean all the time because you’re putting on a brave face?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. It’s that if I am right and not having a child inside of you while doing this wipes your slate clean of all these memories, you are going to owe me dinner.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How will I even know that if I don’t have any memories of this?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll figure that out later.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can I say something as well?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
